A release that gives a lender time but leaves the holder it lends to where it waited.
The holder waits on another queue than its lender's account says.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a thread waits on another queue than its account says

diff --git a/kernel/sched.c b/kernel/sched.c
--- a/kernel/sched.c
+++ b/kernel/sched.c
@@ -527,7 +527,7 @@ static void release(uint32_t c)
             thread_settle(t);
         }
         /* A lender waits on no queue, and its account may give the holder it lends to time. */
-        struct thread *h = t != NULL ? thread_borrower(t) : NULL;
+        struct thread *h = NULL;
         if (h != NULL && (h->queue == QUEUE_SPARE || h->queue == QUEUE_SPENT)) {
             thread_settle(h);
         }
